  "body": "Goal from the notes: describe an organism \"from genome to locomotion\", where light sensors trigger movements, and validate it computationally. Open: what `organism-format/` can already express, what it lacks for sensor-triggered movement, and which toolchain validates a `.life` file end to end. A decoding of the relevant fragments with file references is in `tracks/research/` (decoder section).\n\n_Labels: format, organism-design_",
